# Downloaded Bible source datasets -- large (multi-MB), and the whole point
# of this adapter's design is "bring your own local file, don't commit it"
# (see README.md). Ignore common names/extensions used for these downloads.
kjv.json
web.xml
*.usfx.xml
# eBible.org names its USFX downloads with an underscore (engbsb_usfx.xml),
# which the pattern above does NOT match -- that one is 17MB.
*_usfx.xml
*.zip
*serviceAccountKey*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
